    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Summer, 1941. For Peter, the war is a long way away, being fought by a faceless enemy, marching across places he&apos;s never seen. Until the night it comes to him. A German plane is shot down over the woods that his Dad looked after, before he went off to fight. Peter rushes to the crash site to find something exciting to keep. But what he finds instead is someone: a young and injured German airman. The enemy. Here. And in trouble. Suddenly, helping him seems like the right thing to do</marc:subfield>
